# The real production env file - holds SKYPANE_COMPANION_PASSWORD and the
# rest of deploy/skypane.env.example's values. Created by hand on the VPS
# only (deploy/README.md), never on a laptop, never committed.
# Mirrors firmware/.gitignore's `main/secrets.h` rule - the ignore entry
# exists before the file ever does, so there is no window in which a
# credential could land in git history.
skypane.env
